  "totalBlocks": 17,
  "translatedBlocks": 14,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42753db1f9b949f7",
      "translationZh": "这东西我他妈的已经做了很久，今晚终于发布了 Memoria 1.0.0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05ae8ed0d89f9803",
      "translationZh": "我开发它，是因为我自己确实想用它。我想要一个真正供本地 LLM 应用使用的记忆层，不依赖特定模型、云服务或 API 密钥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "940eb7df90a7abcb",
      "translationZh": "Memoria 以本地优先，与 LLM 无关。它甚至完全不需要 LLM 就能运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d91a2b750b0adadf",
      "translationZh": "我用来开发它并进行基准测试的机器，实在算不上强悍。它搭载的是运行频率为 1.10 GHz 的 Intel Celeron N4020，可用 RAM 约为 3.7 GiB，没有 GPU，运行 Debian Linux。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18b1e98c7df6cbf9",
      "translationZh": "在 LongMemEval-S 上，470 个可用于检索评估的问题中，有 468 个返回了结果。Recall@1 为 89.8%，Recall@5 为 97.9%，Recall@10 为 98.9%，Recall@50 为 99.6%。Session NDCG@10 为 0.9257。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "134526bb19e113d1",
      "translationZh": "完整 LongMemEval 工作负载的峰值 RSS 为 2.65 GiB。单次查询的平均峰值 RSS 约为 580 MiB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63dc8fc9a17c27fc",
      "translationZh": "这个检索系统并不是简单地把所有东西都扔进向量数据库。Memoria 并行运行 FAISS、BM25、图检索、短语匹配、属性检索和时间检索。这些信号会先被融合，再经过多信号排序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa69e426a923e6de",
      "translationZh": "时间检索也采用了独立实现，因此我可以对它进行测量和消融，而不是让它固化在基础检索流程中。它已经可以使用，但仍在积极开发中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a59aa5253a195c74",
      "translationZh": "这次发布还包含许多其他功能：GitHub 仓库导入、Obsidian 知识库导入、MCP 支持、CLI、TUI、GUI 和 API、持久化本地存储、LongMemEval 和 LoCoMo 基准测试工具，以及一个拥有 11 个子系统和 34 个钩子的插件系统。现在还有一个交互式插件生成器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "019f68d537aa065b",
      "translationZh": "而且它确实可以安装：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38ffafdf5a702e87",
      "translationZh": "文档: https://kitzkatz.github.io/memoria/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0d0b0f2c5b42377",
      "translationZh": "我不打算一直等到一个完美的时机才发布它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1268b9ea95280038",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在开发本地智能体或本地 LLM 应用，我真心想听听你的看法，也非常欢迎任何反馈。请尽管把它折腾坏吧",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62c847943af11bbb",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/kitkatz69 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "memory layer",
      "briefZh": "记忆层",
      "explanationZh": "为应用提供信息存储与检索能力的层，使其能够利用此前积累的信息。"
    },
    {
      "term": "local-first",
      "briefZh": "本地优先",
      "explanationZh": "优先在本地设备上运行和处理数据，而不依赖云端服务的设计方式。"
    },
    {
